{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvb4DXSC5K9ergx7VaxC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: don't commit £60k yet, and don't drop it. Spend one to two weeks on a cheap analysis, then decide.**\n\nThe CEO is choosing between two options with no data behind either. You already hold most of the evidence, and the analysis costs days, not £60k.\n\n**Do first:**\n1. **Code the 140 lost deals.** Read the loss reasons and notes for security, compliance, questionnaire or procurement blockers. Many reps log \"went with competitor\" or \"no decision\" when security was the real issue, so also check the notes on the largest losses.\n2. **Check the open pipeline.** Count deals that are stalled or at risk and have asked for SOC 2 or a security questionnaire, and total their value.\n3. **Check wins.** Find out how many enterprise deals closed without SOC 2, and what you gave instead.\n4. **Ask sales** how often security reviews come up, and whether that is rising.\n\n**Decision rule:** set the threshold now, before you see the numbers. For example, if lost plus stalled security-blocked ARR, multiplied by a realistic win rate, exceeds roughly 2–3× the cost within 18 months, start. Budget for annual audit renewals and staff time as well as the £60k.\n\n**Why not drop it:** HR tools hold sensitive personal data, so SOC 2 tends to become a requirement as you move up-market. Three requests in a month may be an early signal.\n\n**Why not start blindly:** one lost deal is thin evidence. Six months of lead time makes delay costly, which is why the analysis should be fast.\n\n**In parallel, at low cost:**\n- Prepare a security whitepaper and a pre-filled questionnaire.\n- Commission a penetration test.\n- Ask prospects whether a SOC 2 Type I, an ISO 27001 certificate or a signed commitment would satisfy them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3446,"cache_read_input_tokens":5036,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3446},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8d058839-f6d7-405a-b7de-f3db92dbddcb","uuid":"9e3772ca-84a2-44f5-9743-12fb294b8373","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:13:40.041Z","request_id":"req_011Cfvb4DHZ4gJB28rgTxu9Q"}
